WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.060 --> 00:00:02.920
A rack that fits its final position can still fail to reach

2
00:00:02.940 --> 00:00:03.460
it safely.

3
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:07.220
Review the complete route from the delivery bay to the installed location,

4
00:00:07.500 --> 00:00:10.640
using the intended loaded configuration and approved handling method.

5
00:00:11.040 --> 00:00:13.660
Include packaging or temporary equipment where applicable.

6
00:00:14.200 --> 00:00:17.480
Measure clearances at doors, turns and overhead obstructions.

7
00:00:17.920 --> 00:00:22.720
Check ramps, lift capacities, floor limits and concentrated loads at wheels, feet

8
00:00:22.920 --> 00:00:23.880
or handling attachments.

9
00:00:24.340 --> 00:00:26.880
Overall mass alone doesn't answer those questions.

10
00:00:27.300 --> 00:00:30.920
Center of gravity, load distribution and the handling state can change the

11
00:00:30.960 --> 00:00:31.800
applicable evidence.

12
00:00:32.299 --> 00:00:36.100
At the final position, preserve connection and service space rather than using

13
00:00:36.180 --> 00:00:38.360
every available clearance as occupied footprint.

14
00:00:38.820 --> 00:00:41.900
Route planning should be owned by the qualified site and handling teams,

15
00:00:42.240 --> 00:00:44.420
not inferred from a frame's nominal dimensions.

16
00:00:44.920 --> 00:00:48.300
Record where equipment is installed or removed during the move and what

17
00:00:48.340 --> 00:00:49.300
inspection follows.

18
00:00:49.780 --> 00:00:51.980
Document the supported route for this configuration.

19
00:00:52.580 --> 00:00:55.460
For a deeper look, check out O C P Academy's Open Data

20
00:00:55.560 --> 00:00:57.880
Center for A I: Applying the Specification.

21
00:00:58.300 --> 00:01:03.060
Its facility compatibility module walks through dock levelers, moving wheel loads, doorway

22
00:01:03.080 --> 00:01:06.640
and turning clearances, and lift capacity, following the move from the delivery

23
00:01:06.720 --> 00:01:07.800
bay to the final row.

